| **"What happens if our webhook fires multiple times for the same transaction?"** | *"Our duplicate transaction checker catches the transaction reference on arrival, logs the replay attempt, and returns HTTP 200 with `{ status: 'success', message: 'Duplicate transaction ignored' }` without double-dispensing."* |
| **"How do you handle differences between Checkout webhooks and Virtual Account webhooks?"** | *"Our webhook controller normalizes both formats: it extracts `transaction_reference`, `virtual_account_number`, and `principal_amount` regardless of whether they arrive at root or nested under `Body`."* |
| **"Are you rate-limiting webhook requests to protect your infrastructure?"** | *"Yes, our `/webhook/squad` endpoint is protected by an Express rate-limiter allowing up to 30 requests per minute per IP, alongside circuit breakers for third-party dispatch."* |
| **"What is your target settlement account for payout withdrawals?"** | *"Withdrawals are handled through verified NUBAN accounts looked up via Squad's account lookup API (`/payout/account/lookup`) and dispatched via Squad Transfer (`/payout/transfer`)."* |

